 ig.de/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#biosig-2026\n
 Notes: 25th annual edition\, run by the GI BIOSIG group with CAST\, BSI\,
  EAB and Fraunhofer IGD\; IEEE technical co-sponsor. biosig.de and the GI
  event page give Nov 25-26\, 2026 at Fraunhofer IGD\, after a Nov 24 foru
 m. The CfP PDF said July 30\; the site's updated deadline is Aug 16\, wit
 h no hour\, so AoE end-of-day is provisional. Double-blind CMT papers: 8 
 pages plus 2 of references (LNI format)\, oral or poster. LNI proceedings
 \; papers go to IEEE Xplore (approval pending in the CfP). No online tick
 et is offered. Size S: 28 papers in the 2026 programme\; 87 attendees in 
 2023. Size is an editorial estimate.
